WEBVTT

1
00:01:20.917 --> 00:01:22.292
It's morning...

2
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:25.000
What a wonderful dream.

3
00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:36.000
No better dream
than a nightmare.

4
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.792
<i>I see it...</i>

5
00:01:40.792 --> 00:01:43.792
<i>I see your pain. as well...</i>

6
00:01:45.042 --> 00:01:48.917
<i>You win. Jugo.</i>

7
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.250
I also see your loyalty...

8
00:01:53.917 --> 00:01:57.375
My son born of darkness.

9
00:01:59.792 --> 00:02:01.125
<i>Come...</i>

10
00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:08.000
<i>No one can stop me.</i>

11
00:02:43.125 --> 00:02:47.542
Their powers switch only
while Yhwach is asleep.

12
00:02:48.542 --> 00:02:49.375
That's right.

13
00:02:49.875 --> 00:02:53.000
Right now. Yhwach does not
have the power of "The Almighty."

14
00:02:53.542 --> 00:02:56.000
He's now in
the upper level of Wahr Welt.

15
00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:57.875
Head up there. Kurosaki!

16
00:02:58.292 --> 00:02:59.375
Ishida!

17
00:03:00.042 --> 00:03:02.417
Are you actually gonna stay here?

18
00:03:02.667 --> 00:03:05.792
If he has Yhwach's powers.
then it's all the more reason—!

19
00:03:05.792 --> 00:03:08.292
Quit talking and go!

20
00:03:09.792 --> 00:03:11.792
Besides. those won't be my last words.

21
00:03:38.625 --> 00:03:40.292
Is everything okay. Inoue?

22
00:03:40.625 --> 00:03:43.000
I'm fine.
I'm okay.

23
00:03:43.542 --> 00:03:46.917
I just...kinda felt relieved.

24
00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:48.125
Relieved?

25
00:03:50.542 --> 00:03:51.500
How do I put it?

26
00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:57.625
I never believed Ishida
actually joined the Quincy. but...

27
00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:03.292
hearing him say it directly
was a relief. I guess.

28
00:04:04.875 --> 00:04:09.417
I was just thinking
Ishida was still the same Ishida...

29
00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:13.542
What's that?!

30
00:04:31.792 --> 00:04:33.375
- Chad!
- Sado!

31
00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.750
I'm okay.
Just go!

32
00:04:43.042 --> 00:04:45.292
Okay...
Let's do this.

33
00:04:46.542 --> 00:04:48.625
Turn to sand!

34
00:04:50.667 --> 00:04:51.667
Oh. it's you. Ganju.

35
00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.000
Where have you been?

36
00:04:53.125 --> 00:04:55.042
"Where have you been?" my butt!

37
00:04:55.042 --> 00:04:57.125
You left me
and went off on your own!

38
00:04:57.542 --> 00:04:59.625
I got separated and got lost!

39
00:04:59.625 --> 00:05:03.125
That's when I saw this perfect
moment to use my skills.

40
00:05:03.542 --> 00:05:05.667
A group of stone statues
is perfect!

41
00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:08.542
My Seppa was made for this!

42
00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:09.792
Hey. listen to me!

43
00:05:10.417 --> 00:05:12.542
- I'm listening.
- Are you really. though?

44
00:05:12.625 --> 00:05:15.375
Give me a reaction or something!

45
00:05:17.292 --> 00:05:20.125
Do you like doing
unglamorous grunt work. Ganju?

46
00:05:22.875 --> 00:05:25.667
Ichigo only sees the path
that's in front of him.

47
00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:27.125
That's how he is.

48
00:05:28.167 --> 00:05:34.875
Our job is to clean out the castle
and pave a path back for Ichigo.

49
00:05:51.042 --> 00:05:54.667
<i>Haschwalth can't see</i>
<i>the complete future...</i>

50
00:05:55.625 --> 00:05:58.125
<i>You surprise me. Uryu Ishida.</i>

51
00:05:58.625 --> 00:06:01.000
<i>You look completely different</i>
<i>from who you were earlier.</i>

52
00:06:01.792 --> 00:06:05.625
<i>You seem so full of hope now.</i>

53
00:06:06.042 --> 00:06:07.125
<i>I see.</i>

54
00:06:07.542 --> 00:06:11.167
<i>Setting aside whether or not</i>
<i>I am full of hope or not.</i>

55
00:06:11.875 --> 00:06:14.250
<i>the fact that you're surprised...</i>

56
00:06:14.792 --> 00:06:18.917
<i>...means you did not foresee me</i>
<i>being filled with hope. did you?</i>

57
00:06:21.125 --> 00:06:25.000
<i>At that time.</i>
<i>he didn't confirm or deny it.</i>

58
00:06:30.625 --> 00:06:34.917
Like I keep telling you.
I see everything.

59
00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:47.542
<i>In that case. I'll just confirm</i>
<i>how much you can see.</i>

60
00:07:07.542 --> 00:07:08.667
<i>They're not hitting him...!</i>

61
00:07:08.875 --> 00:07:11.000
<i>So. he can see everything.</i>
<i>after all?</i>

62
00:07:17.625 --> 00:07:20.625
Seems you're limiting
my angles of attack

63
00:07:20.625 --> 00:07:23.375
by standing with your back
to the walls and ceiling.

64
00:07:23.792 --> 00:07:26.667
Then you need only to concentrate
on what's in front of you.

65
00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:31.292
I praise you for fighting
a cerebral battle. Uryu Ishida.

66
00:07:31.792 --> 00:07:34.750
As I'd expect from you.
Grand Master.

67
00:07:34.875 --> 00:07:37.875
But I don't appreciate your praise.

68
00:07:50.042 --> 00:07:52.625
Your life is in my hands...

69
00:08:09.292 --> 00:08:13.000
Right now. the power of
His Majesty fills my body.

70
00:08:13.417 --> 00:08:16.625
Trying to take these powers
from me is futile.

71
00:08:18.125 --> 00:08:19.375
Uryu Ishida...

72
00:08:19.625 --> 00:08:21.375
You cannot be me.

73
00:08:22.125 --> 00:08:24.000
I am His Majesty's other half.

74
00:08:24.292 --> 00:08:27.292
I am a Quincy born to be together
with His Majesty.

75
00:08:28.167 --> 00:08:32.375
That is why His Majesty entrusted
his powers to me.

76
00:08:34.792 --> 00:08:35.917
Can you see it?

77
00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.542
Can you see what is
about to happen next?

78
00:08:42.667 --> 00:08:44.792
What is that?!

79
00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:48.292
This is His Majesty's true wish.

80
00:08:50.042 --> 00:08:51.292
It's a hit!

81
00:08:51.875 --> 00:08:55.167
Jinta Home-Run!

82
00:08:59.417 --> 00:09:02.667
Uh...
What is that huge crack?!

83
00:09:03.625 --> 00:09:07.125
It's identical to that "distortion"
Kisuke was investigating...

84
00:09:07.875 --> 00:09:09.042
Wait a minute!!

85
00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:12.167
A "distortion" is a concentration
of dangerous energy...

86
00:09:12.292 --> 00:09:14.875
I thought the Manager
and the others fixed it!

87
00:09:15.167 --> 00:09:17.625
He was supposed to. but...

88
00:09:17.917 --> 00:09:22.292
Isn't it dangerous to stay in
this town...or even in this world?

89
00:09:22.292 --> 00:09:23.625
Isn't that right. Tessai?

90
00:09:25.375 --> 00:09:26.250
<i>Mr. Urahara...</i>

91
00:09:29.792 --> 00:09:31.500
Did you say. his true wish?

92
00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.917
Everything is proceeding according
to His Majesty's plan

93
00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.375
that began with the attack
on Soul Society.

94
00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:42.042
The extermination of
massive numbers of Hollows

95
00:09:42.125 --> 00:09:44.792
from the World of the Living
greatly upset the balance of souls

96
00:09:45.542 --> 00:09:49.292
Our invasion fooled
many Soul Reapers.

97
00:09:49.917 --> 00:09:51.542
The deaths of Genryusai Yamamoto

98
00:09:51.542 --> 00:09:54.042
followed by members of Squad Zero

99
00:09:54.292 --> 00:09:58.792
upset the balance
in this world to its core.

100
00:09:59.542 --> 00:10:02.542
And the Soul King. who was
the linchpin of the Three Worlds.

101
00:10:02.625 --> 00:10:04.750
became a part of
His Majesty's power.

102
00:10:05.917 --> 00:10:07.417
This crack is a prelude

103
00:10:07.542 --> 00:10:10.250
to the annihilation
of the Three Worlds.

104
00:10:10.875 --> 00:10:12.625
Annihilation of the Three Worlds...

105
00:10:14.875 --> 00:10:16.917
What are you trying to do?

106
00:10:17.292 --> 00:10:19.167
You've probably
heard before.

107
00:10:20.292 --> 00:10:21.250
It's called "Welt."

108
00:10:23.292 --> 00:10:25.250
We are creating a new world.

109
00:10:26.167 --> 00:10:27.875
We will destroy the Three Worlds

110
00:10:28.125 --> 00:10:31.750
to create a monarchy
of and for Quincy.

111
00:10:32.417 --> 00:10:34.500
That is His Majesty's true wish

112
00:10:34.792 --> 00:10:38.417
and it is the duty Stern Ritter
must fulfill for their brethren.

113
00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:44.250
You are not a part of that future
that I see.

114
00:10:47.542 --> 00:10:49.417
Dealing with traitors...

115
00:10:51.292 --> 00:10:52.792
...is also my job!

116
00:11:02.167 --> 00:11:05.125
Spoken like
His Majesty's mouthpiece.

117
00:11:07.625 --> 00:11:11.667
After hearing what you said.
my to-do list just grew.

118
00:11:12.542 --> 00:11:16.792
First. defeat you to eliminate
"The Almighty."

119
00:11:17.875 --> 00:11:23.875
Second. eliminate this rift
and protect the Three Worlds.

120
00:11:39.625 --> 00:11:43.000
Can't believe
I didn't have to move...

121
00:11:50.583 --> 00:11:52.583
...to survive all that!

122
00:11:53.542 --> 00:11:57.917
I feel it. I feel myself moving
farther away from death.

123
00:11:58.583 --> 00:12:02.667
If my immunity is the ultimate way
to avoid death.

124
00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.958
maybe I have immunity to
thank for this as well.

125
00:12:07.167 --> 00:12:11.042
What do you think.
Yoruichi Shihoin?

126
00:12:13.125 --> 00:12:17.833
Sorry. I thought you were talking
to yourself. so I wasn't listening.

127
00:12:18.333 --> 00:12:21.125
More like you
couldn't listen. right?

128
00:12:21.583 --> 00:12:23.792
I fired off a hybrid Gift Ball

129
00:12:23.792 --> 00:12:26.458
of Spiritual Pressure.
Oxygen. and Nitrogen.

130
00:12:27.042 --> 00:12:30.417
You didn't have the luxury of
listening to pointless mutterings...

131
00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:36.167
Honestly. I'm surprised
you're not dead in your condition.

132
00:12:36.583 --> 00:12:37.542
Likewise...

133
00:12:38.083 --> 00:12:40.625
After all that fiddling
with fatal dosage...

134
00:12:41.167 --> 00:12:47.125
I'm not sure why you adjusted it
enough to keep me barely alive.

135
00:12:47.375 --> 00:12:49.167
You're wrong.

136
00:12:49.167 --> 00:12:51.292
I did the best that I could.

137
00:12:51.833 --> 00:12:54.333
Anyone else would have
been dead by now.

138
00:12:56.167 --> 00:12:58.833
Stop ignoring that you're a freak

139
00:12:59.083 --> 00:13:02.458
and making it sound like
I went easy on you.

140
00:13:03.042 --> 00:13:04.292
It's a real bummer.

141
00:13:12.083 --> 00:13:14.833
<i>Yushiro won't last much longer...</i>

142
00:13:15.542 --> 00:13:19.208
<i>But I don't have the strength</i>
<i>to heal him in my condition.</i>

143
00:13:20.625 --> 00:13:21.625
<i>In that case!</i>

144
00:13:22.292 --> 00:13:23.167
Don't bother.

145
00:13:24.792 --> 00:13:27.208
I don't know what you're up to...

146
00:13:27.458 --> 00:13:29.792
But you're at death's door.

147
00:13:29.792 --> 00:13:32.000
You couldn't even react
at this distance.

148
00:13:33.917 --> 00:13:36.000
No matter what you try
in the state you're in now.

149
00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.417
I'm confident I can strike first.

150
00:13:39.125 --> 00:13:44.208
That's pretty fatal.
don't you think. Yoruichi Shihoin?

151
00:13:44.208 --> 00:13:45.042
Indeed!

152
00:13:45.792 --> 00:13:48.417
You've been dealt
a fatal wedgie. Yoruichi.

153
00:13:48.875 --> 00:13:50.042
That hurt my chin!

154
00:13:50.292 --> 00:13:53.292
I came all this way to save you.
Why'd you kick me?!

155
00:13:53.292 --> 00:13:55.208
What made you think I wouldn't?!

156
00:13:55.417 --> 00:13:57.542
Look at me!
Stop staring at my butt!

157
00:13:58.292 --> 00:13:59.542
Sorry...

158
00:13:59.542 --> 00:14:03.000
You're right. Perhaps ‘wedgie"
was a bit vulgar.

159
00:14:03.042 --> 00:14:04.792
That's not why I kicked you!

160
00:14:04.833 --> 00:14:06.708
And stop touching my butt
while apologizing!

161
00:14:06.917 --> 00:14:08.708
Kisuke Urahara...

162
00:14:08.708 --> 00:14:11.292
Another troublemaker
to deal with...

163
00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:15.458
Oh. you know me?
Much obliged.

164
00:14:15.792 --> 00:14:17.292
<i>Do I know you?</i>

165
00:14:17.333 --> 00:14:19.083
You may not know this.

166
00:14:19.083 --> 00:14:21.583
but you're one
of the Special Threats

167
00:14:21.625 --> 00:14:23.333
designated personally
by His Majesty.

168
00:14:23.917 --> 00:14:28.042
I'm honored to be included
among such esteemed company.

169
00:14:28.792 --> 00:14:31.042
It's a privilege. but he's
giving me too much credit.

170
00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.125
Isn't that right. Yoruichi?

171
00:14:37.167 --> 00:14:38.375
What?!

172
00:14:40.792 --> 00:14:42.292
<i>What did he do?</i>

173
00:14:42.708 --> 00:14:45.000
<i>How is Yoruichi Shihoin</i>
<i>able to move?!</i>

174
00:14:45.125 --> 00:14:47.208
<i>Did he undo my Death Dealing?!</i>

175
00:14:47.625 --> 00:14:48.792
<i>How?!</i>

176
00:14:51.083 --> 00:14:53.917
<i>No. this is exactly</i>
<i>what I've been told about.</i>

177
00:14:54.833 --> 00:14:56.292
<i>The five Special Threats</i>
<i>were chosen</i>

178
00:14:56.375 --> 00:14:58.042
<i>for their incalculable aspects.</i>

179
00:14:58.542 --> 00:15:00.833
<i>Ichigo Kurosaki</i>
<i>for his "potential."</i>

180
00:15:01.458 --> 00:15:03.708
<i>Kenpachi Zaraki</i>
<i>for his "combat strength."</i>

181
00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.208
<i>Ichibei Hyosube for his "wisdom."</i>

182
00:15:06.542 --> 00:15:08.833
<i>Sosuke Aizen</i>
<i>for his "Spiritual Pressure."</i>

183
00:15:09.708 --> 00:15:12.042
<i>And Kisuke Urahara</i>

184
00:15:12.167 --> 00:15:13.875
<i>for his "incalculable tricks!"</i>

185
00:15:14.542 --> 00:15:16.875
<i>Regardless of what strategy</i>
<i>you use.</i>

186
00:15:16.875 --> 00:15:18.917
<i>he will always outsmart you.</i>

187
00:15:18.917 --> 00:15:21.542
<i>He is the consummate schemer!</i>

188
00:15:22.125 --> 00:15:25.667
<i>Man...Why am I the one</i>

189
00:15:25.792 --> 00:15:28.542
<i>who always has to face</i>
<i>these troublemakers?!</i>

190
00:15:35.542 --> 00:15:37.292
What did you inject into my butt?

191
00:15:38.875 --> 00:15:39.875
It's a secret.

192
00:15:40.542 --> 00:15:43.417
An immunity enhancing
agent you cooked up

193
00:15:43.417 --> 00:15:44.917
while hiding
and eavesdropping on us...

194
00:15:44.958 --> 00:15:46.667
Am I right?

195
00:15:46.792 --> 00:15:48.208
As expected. Yoruichi!

196
00:15:48.292 --> 00:15:49.792
How astute of you.

197
00:15:49.875 --> 00:15:52.917
I had to rush and improvise.
so its effect won't last long.

198
00:15:52.958 --> 00:15:53.958
How long?

199
00:15:54.833 --> 00:15:56.458
About 5 minutes. maybe?

200
00:15:57.125 --> 00:15:57.958
That's plenty!

201
00:15:58.292 --> 00:15:59.333
Shunko!

202
00:16:00.125 --> 00:16:02.542
- Raijin Senkei...
- Hold on. Yoruichi.

203
00:16:03.083 --> 00:16:05.042
What?!
You got more to say?!

204
00:16:05.708 --> 00:16:07.000
Let's try that thing...

205
00:16:07.542 --> 00:16:08.542
No!

206
00:16:08.792 --> 00:16:10.667
Why'd you shoot me down so quick?

207
00:16:10.792 --> 00:16:14.208
Let me try to explain and
negotiate with you...

208
00:16:14.708 --> 00:16:18.667
I never want to be that half-assed.
grotesque form ever again!

209
00:16:19.083 --> 00:16:21.292
I see...
Too bad.

210
00:16:21.875 --> 00:16:24.292
I don't want to do this.
but you force my hand...

211
00:16:27.417 --> 00:16:29.458
Oops! Bummer.
I missed.

212
00:16:33.708 --> 00:16:34.875
Hey...

213
00:16:35.542 --> 00:16:37.708
It's nice that you're able to move.

214
00:16:37.708 --> 00:16:40.000
and it's great
you're excited. but...

215
00:16:44.792 --> 00:16:48.083
I hit you with the Gift Ball when
you were in perfect condition...

216
00:16:48.375 --> 00:16:50.208
Do you really think you can beat me

217
00:16:50.292 --> 00:16:53.667
just because you
recovered a little bit?

218
00:16:56.375 --> 00:16:58.042
Yoruichi!

219
00:17:12.292 --> 00:17:14.542
<i>What just happened?!</i>

220
00:17:22.917 --> 00:17:25.792
W-What kind of form is that?!

221
00:17:28.875 --> 00:17:31.625
Hey. don't ignore me!

222
00:17:32.375 --> 00:17:36.583
Shunko: Raiju Senkei
Shunryu Kokubyo Senki.

223
00:17:37.417 --> 00:17:38.292
That's what.

224
00:17:39.417 --> 00:17:43.375
Okay. but why are you
the one saying it?

225
00:17:45.542 --> 00:17:47.167
<i>Could it be?</i>

226
00:17:47.167 --> 00:17:50.375
<i>Can she not understand</i>
<i>what I'm saying right now?</i>

227
00:18:01.583 --> 00:18:03.208
No way!

228
00:18:11.958 --> 00:18:13.042
How is this happening?

229
00:18:13.208 --> 00:18:16.542
I should be immune to
her Spiritual Pressure already!

230
00:18:16.708 --> 00:18:18.917
It's not possible for
a Soul Reaper's Spiritual Pressure

231
00:18:18.917 --> 00:18:20.125
to change midway like this!

232
00:18:20.375 --> 00:18:21.708
What's going on?!

233
00:18:21.958 --> 00:18:23.292
She's moody.

234
00:18:24.208 --> 00:18:26.917
You know how they say
cats can be fickle?

235
00:18:27.458 --> 00:18:29.667
Yoruichi's moods
in her Kokubyo Senki form

236
00:18:29.792 --> 00:18:31.583
shows in her Spiritual Pressure.

237
00:18:32.167 --> 00:18:34.833
See how she's not coming
after you right now?

238
00:18:34.875 --> 00:18:36.625
It's because she's not in the mood.

239
00:18:37.125 --> 00:18:42.708
Yoruichi's moody to begin with.
but in that form.

240
00:18:42.917 --> 00:18:47.167
her Spiritual Pressure becomes
more erratic.

241
00:18:48.542 --> 00:18:51.167
It's almost like
someone else's Spiritual Pressure.

242
00:18:54.542 --> 00:18:56.833
You know how the flu
spreads every year?

243
00:18:57.792 --> 00:18:59.083
Even if it's not a new strain.

244
00:18:59.167 --> 00:19:01.333
just a tiny mutation
in antigenicity

245
00:19:01.417 --> 00:19:03.917
and last year's strain Type A
spreads again.

246
00:19:04.333 --> 00:19:05.875
It's sort of like that.

247
00:19:06.375 --> 00:19:08.792
Even if your body keeps
building up immunity.

248
00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.417
one small change
makes it all for nothing.

249
00:19:12.458 --> 00:19:15.625
Sure. your immunity
acquisition rate

250
00:19:15.708 --> 00:19:17.792
is incredibly fast...

251
00:19:18.375 --> 00:19:20.458
When you're attacked.

252
00:19:20.542 --> 00:19:22.542
you reflexively analyze
the Spiritual Pressure

253
00:19:22.625 --> 00:19:25.625
and build immunity
at a terrifying speed.

254
00:19:26.833 --> 00:19:30.333
It takes you just a minute
to nullify any attack.

255
00:19:30.917 --> 00:19:32.792
But that's not fast enough.

256
00:19:33.292 --> 00:19:35.792
The Spiritual Pressure when
Yoruichi's in Kokubyo Senki

257
00:19:35.792 --> 00:19:38.625
changes 48 times per second.

258
00:20:00.417 --> 00:20:01.292
Hey!

259
00:20:03.625 --> 00:20:06.792
Yoruichi...
I have Yoru-nip for you.

260
00:20:07.208 --> 00:20:08.542
Come here.

261
00:20:11.583 --> 00:20:12.417
Ouch!

262
00:20:20.292 --> 00:20:21.833
Okay. okay!

263
00:20:22.917 --> 00:20:23.792
Oh boy...

264
00:20:24.375 --> 00:20:26.708
I'm the only one
who can control her.

265
00:20:26.708 --> 00:20:28.917
and she can only revert back
if she's in the mood...

266
00:20:28.917 --> 00:20:30.583
I guess that's the drawback
with this form.

267
00:20:31.208 --> 00:20:35.167
Well. Yoruichi in this form is cute
in her own way.

268
00:20:35.458 --> 00:20:37.542
so I don't really mind.

269
00:20:38.167 --> 00:20:40.875
Oh. it's been almost five minutes.

270
00:20:41.542 --> 00:20:43.708
The immuno enhancer
is about to wear off.

271
00:20:44.333 --> 00:20:46.042
You did well. Yoruichi.

272
00:20:46.667 --> 00:20:48.667
Take your time detoxing
from the poison.

273
00:20:49.708 --> 00:20:52.958
I'm going to look for his body
and make sure he's dead.

274
00:21:03.625 --> 00:21:05.208
What's the hell is this?

275
00:21:06.458 --> 00:21:08.083
A Gift Ball Deluxe.

276
00:21:09.375 --> 00:21:12.000
The largest Gift Ball I can create.

277
00:21:12.542 --> 00:21:15.542
Oh! That's not
what's bothering you?

278
00:21:16.083 --> 00:21:18.583
Are you bothered
by the way I look?

279
00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.042
It's called Hass Hein.

280
00:21:21.667 --> 00:21:23.792
Not that cool of a name. right?

281
00:21:44.708 --> 00:21:46.458
What are you doing. Orihime?

282
00:21:47.333 --> 00:21:49.417
Yeah...
I was just thinking that

283
00:21:49.542 --> 00:21:52.167
this flower kind of reminds me
of Kurosaki.

284
00:21:52.542 --> 00:21:53.792
What? It does?

285
00:21:54.042 --> 00:21:55.875
Ichigo's not as red
like that flower.

286
00:21:55.917 --> 00:21:57.167
but isn't he
more like that one?

287
00:21:57.792 --> 00:21:59.375
Huh. I think you're right.

288
00:21:59.542 --> 00:22:01.375
Well. it doesn't really matter
which one he is.

289
00:22:01.625 --> 00:22:03.792
We can talk about Ichigo later.

290
00:22:04.333 --> 00:22:05.292
Anyway. let's get going.

291
00:22:05.583 --> 00:22:08.583
We need to finish seeing everything
by half past the hour.

292
00:22:08.917 --> 00:22:10.792
Oh yes. you're right...

293
00:22:11.083 --> 00:22:12.292
Yup. I am!

294
00:22:12.625 --> 00:22:14.833
Double period classes
are such a pain!

295
00:22:25.208 --> 00:22:27.833
<i>Kurosaki's heart must surely be...</i>

296
00:22:36.875 --> 00:22:38.792
<i>...the same color as that flower.</i>

297
00:22:39.958 --> 00:22:44.583
<i>Warm. kind and shining its light</i>
<i>brightly on everything around it....</i>

298
00:22:45.625 --> 00:22:47.167
<i>In order to protect everyone.</i>

299
00:22:50.792 --> 00:22:52.125
<i>That's why I decided...</i>

300
00:22:54.292 --> 00:22:56.292
<i>Kurosaki. I—!</i>

301
00:22:57.875 --> 00:23:01.458
Spiritual Pressure that changes
48 times per second...

302
00:23:03.292 --> 00:23:04.708
Put another way...

303
00:23:05.167 --> 00:23:09.125
I can get a taste of
all 48 versions in one second.

304
00:23:09.583 --> 00:23:11.542
In other words.
if I can withstand her attack

305
00:23:11.625 --> 00:23:14.333
for just one second in
my Vollständig form.

306
00:23:15.125 --> 00:23:17.667
I'll be infected 48 times.

307
00:23:19.583 --> 00:23:23.875
Then all I need...is time to analyze
and acquire immunity.

308
00:23:24.833 --> 00:23:25.667
Oh. and...

309
00:23:26.333 --> 00:23:30.625
Maybe there's a way to alter
her Spiritual Pressure even more.

310
00:23:31.042 --> 00:23:32.292
but it won't do any good.

311
00:23:32.917 --> 00:23:35.542
Just so you don't waste
any time and effort.

312
00:23:35.583 --> 00:23:36.958
out of kindness...

313
00:23:37.042 --> 00:23:40.292
I'll tell you the capabilities
of my Vollständig.

314
00:23:40.625 --> 00:23:46.208
My Vollständig. Hass Hein adapts
to the changes in a poison.

315
00:23:46.833 --> 00:23:49.417
No matter how much the surface
layer of a poison changes.

316
00:23:49.542 --> 00:23:50.958
if the base is the same.

317
00:23:51.000 --> 00:23:54.792
Hass Hein can alter the immunity
and instantly nullify it.

318
00:23:55.583 --> 00:23:57.208
Was that was too wordy?

319
00:23:57.458 --> 00:23:59.333
But you get it. right?

320
00:24:00.042 --> 00:24:01.167
From here on out.

321
00:24:01.292 --> 00:24:04.542
the both of you can change your
Spiritual Pressures all you want.

322
00:24:05.375 --> 00:24:09.583
But you won't be able to put
a scratch on me.

323
00:24:10.542 --> 00:24:13.458
So. what will you do.
Kisuke Urahara?

324
00:24:13.833 --> 00:24:14.833
Don't tell me...

325
00:24:14.958 --> 00:24:18.167
Just because I negated
all your moves from 1 to 10.

326
00:24:18.625 --> 00:24:21.375
that you're at your wit's end!

327
00:24:26.542 --> 00:24:28.458
Don't be so surprised.

328
00:24:28.708 --> 00:24:29.958
I'm just making sure.

329
00:24:30.625 --> 00:24:32.583
I divided the Bereich.

330
00:24:33.583 --> 00:24:36.375
I'm not fond of speaking
in absolutes. you see.

331
00:24:37.167 --> 00:24:41.167
People who do. appear unsure
of themselves. don't they?

332
00:24:41.792 --> 00:24:44.458
I want to be a man
who is in control.

333
00:24:46.000 --> 00:24:47.417
But I will say this.

334
00:24:48.292 --> 00:24:53.000
It is absolutely impossible
to escape this Gift Bereich.

335
00:24:54.000 --> 00:24:57.208
You really don't want us to escape.
do you?

336
00:24:57.542 --> 00:25:00.208
Of course not.
Why even ask?

337
00:25:00.417 --> 00:25:02.083
You and I are enemies.

338
00:25:02.542 --> 00:25:05.458
Well. I hate to be
the one to say this.

339
00:25:05.833 --> 00:25:09.958
but you didn't seem to me like
a guy who acts out of loyalty.

340
00:25:10.542 --> 00:25:12.417
Now that was rude.

341
00:25:12.792 --> 00:25:16.375
I like to think I have twice
the loyalty of a Pomeranian.

342
00:25:17.167 --> 00:25:19.417
But you're not wrong...

343
00:25:19.875 --> 00:25:21.667
Loyalty isn't everything.

344
00:25:22.792 --> 00:25:24.958
I'm interested in His Majesty.

345
00:25:26.292 --> 00:25:29.667
When I say "interested."
does that sound condescending?

346
00:25:30.167 --> 00:25:31.958
Of course.
I don't mean it that way.

347
00:25:33.083 --> 00:25:36.542
The World of the Living.
Hueco Mundo. Soul Society...

348
00:25:37.167 --> 00:25:39.292
Destroying three entire worlds...

349
00:25:39.292 --> 00:25:41.875
...then aiming to build something new!

350
00:25:42.208 --> 00:25:44.917
Who else but His Majesty
could do that?

351
00:25:45.542 --> 00:25:47.667
Let's say.
if we lose His Majesty here...

352
00:25:48.083 --> 00:25:51.833
do you think anybody else like him
would emerge to take his place?

353
00:25:52.792 --> 00:25:54.125
Kisuke Urahara...

354
00:25:54.625 --> 00:25:56.167
You're a smart guy...

355
00:25:56.792 --> 00:25:59.417
You look like a man who has seen
everything there is to see.

356
00:25:59.625 --> 00:26:01.583
Aren't you even a bit curious?

357
00:26:02.292 --> 00:26:06.542
What will His Majesty create after
he destroys the Three Worlds?

358
00:26:07.000 --> 00:26:09.167
Don't you want to see
what it will be?

359
00:26:12.458 --> 00:26:15.000
You're still able to
move that quickly?

360
00:26:15.708 --> 00:26:18.333
That's impressive
inside this Gift Bereich.

361
00:26:19.375 --> 00:26:21.333
No. I don't think I do.

362
00:26:21.958 --> 00:26:23.625
Is that your answer
to my earlier question?

363
00:26:23.708 --> 00:26:25.333
That's too bad.

364
00:26:25.625 --> 00:26:28.875
I thought you'd be more like me.

365
00:26:29.042 --> 00:26:31.458
Perhaps Captain Kurotsuchi
might have said

366
00:26:32.000 --> 00:26:35.333
he wanted to see something new.

367
00:26:35.667 --> 00:26:37.708
Mayuri Kurotsuchi. huh...?

368
00:26:37.792 --> 00:26:39.208
But even in his case.

369
00:26:39.583 --> 00:26:43.167
it doesn't mean he'd want to see
what Yhwach creates.

370
00:26:43.708 --> 00:26:46.375
If you want to see something created
that nobody's ever seen before.

371
00:26:46.375 --> 00:26:47.792
it should be made
by your own hand.

372
00:26:48.167 --> 00:26:50.208
That's how scientists are.

373
00:26:52.292 --> 00:26:53.958
I see.

374
00:26:54.292 --> 00:26:56.417
I don't hate that answer.

375
00:26:57.167 --> 00:27:01.000
Still. I'd rather see
His Majesty's version!

376
00:27:01.167 --> 00:27:02.542
Gift Ring!

377
00:27:04.875 --> 00:27:05.792
<i>It disappeared?!</i>

378
00:27:11.417 --> 00:27:15.292
I use Gift Ring on guys
who are ridiculously strong

379
00:27:15.292 --> 00:27:18.292
on whom the Death Dealing
doesn't work.

380
00:27:18.417 --> 00:27:19.292
It's effect...

381
00:27:19.875 --> 00:27:22.792
focuses the ability of
the Death Dealing on a single point

382
00:27:23.333 --> 00:27:25.042
that's been pierced with
pinpoint accuracy

383
00:27:25.125 --> 00:27:27.208
and instantly killing
that precise section.

384
00:27:30.458 --> 00:27:33.375
It's your fault
for being too strong.

385
00:27:33.458 --> 00:27:35.625
Lowering the lethal dose
did no good.

386
00:27:35.792 --> 00:27:38.000
Eliminating all your moves
didn't do it.

387
00:27:39.125 --> 00:27:41.833
So. destroying
every single organ of yours

388
00:27:41.917 --> 00:27:44.292
is the only way left to kill you.

389
00:27:45.000 --> 00:27:46.417
You've got me here...

390
00:27:46.958 --> 00:27:49.375
You're really hellbent
on killing me!

391
00:27:51.042 --> 00:27:52.583
Guess I have no choice.

392
00:27:55.833 --> 00:27:56.875
Bankai.

393
00:28:11.792 --> 00:28:14.375
Kannon-Biraki Benihime Aratame.

394
00:28:15.208 --> 00:28:18.125
Whoa...
What is that?

395
00:28:18.917 --> 00:28:20.333
That's a Bankai?

396
00:28:20.875 --> 00:28:22.167
Your Bankai...

397
00:28:22.458 --> 00:28:26.542
wasn't in the information
I received from His Majesty.

398
00:28:27.042 --> 00:28:31.208
This is the first time I've used it
among present company.

399
00:28:32.083 --> 00:28:34.458
I see...that's how it is.

400
00:28:35.125 --> 00:28:39.042
So. I might as well ask...
What does it do?

401
00:28:39.333 --> 00:28:41.292
You're actually asking?

402
00:28:41.292 --> 00:28:42.792
I'm not telling.

403
00:28:43.000 --> 00:28:45.083
Well. okay. I figured.

404
00:28:45.167 --> 00:28:47.917
It's just kinda scary confronting it
without knowing what it does.

405
00:28:48.292 --> 00:28:49.458
I get it.

406
00:28:49.625 --> 00:28:53.292
But you'll find out soon enough.

407
00:28:57.458 --> 00:28:59.167
<i>What the...hell is this?!</i>

408
00:29:09.083 --> 00:29:10.625
You're so calm!

409
00:29:11.167 --> 00:29:14.792
Most people are so surprised
that they try to cut off their arm.

410
00:29:15.833 --> 00:29:20.000
As you've now realized.
my Bankai's effect is "ranged."

411
00:29:21.375 --> 00:29:24.125
I don't have the guts
to cut my arm off.

412
00:29:24.542 --> 00:29:27.375
You might have realized
from the first strike...

413
00:29:27.542 --> 00:29:28.542
<i>What...</i>

414
00:29:28.708 --> 00:29:30.167
<i>What is he doing?</i>

415
00:29:30.792 --> 00:29:33.708
Kannon-Biraki Benihime
Aratame's ability...

416
00:29:35.000 --> 00:29:37.667
is reconstructing
whatever it touches.

417
00:29:46.792 --> 00:29:48.625
What?! You can see?!

418
00:29:48.792 --> 00:29:51.125
But I killed your eyes instantly!

419
00:29:51.292 --> 00:29:52.458
I can see!

420
00:29:52.583 --> 00:29:54.792
They've been reconstructed.
you see...

421
00:30:21.125 --> 00:30:22.625
Ugh. I hate this.

422
00:30:23.042 --> 00:30:26.125
I really. really. really
really hate this!

423
00:30:26.792 --> 00:30:29.000
This has turned into
a clash of brute force.

424
00:30:29.000 --> 00:30:30.958
the kind of fight I hate!

425
00:30:31.292 --> 00:30:36.000
I finally dragged you onto my turf
to fight on my terms.

426
00:30:36.125 --> 00:30:39.167
then you go and mess it all up.

427
00:30:39.958 --> 00:30:42.375
You're a bad man. Kisuke Urahara.

428
00:30:45.292 --> 00:30:46.125
But.

429
00:30:46.292 --> 00:30:48.208
you're not perfect!

430
00:30:48.708 --> 00:30:50.083
You haven't forgotten. have you?

431
00:30:51.417 --> 00:30:55.875
My Gift Ball Deluxe is
an inescapable fortress of poison!

432
00:30:56.542 --> 00:30:59.333
You're able to breathe inside of it

433
00:30:59.583 --> 00:31:02.042
only because I'm moderating it!

434
00:31:30.958 --> 00:31:33.208
Give me a break. here!

435
00:31:33.542 --> 00:31:35.542
You're not going to raise
the concentration

436
00:31:35.625 --> 00:31:37.375
of Gift Ball Deluxe even more.
are you?!

437
00:31:41.125 --> 00:31:45.875
As it is.
I can just barely crawl...

438
00:31:46.042 --> 00:31:47.542
That's rich coming from you.

439
00:31:47.583 --> 00:31:48.792
I already know!

440
00:31:49.792 --> 00:31:54.167
Your Bankai is dangerous even
if you're crawling on the ground!

441
00:31:54.292 --> 00:31:56.958
Impressive.
You're quite perceptive.

442
00:31:57.542 --> 00:31:59.625
But it's already too late.

443
00:32:06.875 --> 00:32:08.542
What happened?

444
00:32:09.625 --> 00:32:11.042
It's been bugging me...

445
00:32:11.875 --> 00:32:16.333
You said that this Gift Ball Deluxe
was inescapable.

446
00:32:16.958 --> 00:32:19.167
but you did not say
it was impenetrable.

447
00:32:20.042 --> 00:32:21.292
So. I thought as a test...

448
00:32:21.792 --> 00:32:26.167
Why not create a direct path
into the ball from the outside?

449
00:32:27.042 --> 00:32:29.417
Thank you for your help...

450
00:32:30.458 --> 00:32:31.583
Mr. Grimmjow.

451
00:32:41.542 --> 00:32:42.833
So. you're...

452
00:32:43.583 --> 00:32:45.833
moving around again.

453
00:32:46.542 --> 00:32:48.125
Impressive.

454
00:32:48.542 --> 00:32:51.792
I underestimated you.

455
00:32:52.333 --> 00:32:56.958
What? You're still alive even with
a crushed heart?

456
00:32:57.792 --> 00:33:01.333
I healed him.
On my way here.

457
00:33:02.292 --> 00:33:05.667
The Arrancars who had their masks
torn off by Aizen

458
00:33:06.083 --> 00:33:08.958
can completely transform
their Spiritual Pressures

459
00:33:09.000 --> 00:33:12.000
from an Arrancar's to
a Hollow's using Resurrección.

460
00:33:12.542 --> 00:33:16.042
I thought that might be
useful in battle.

461
00:33:16.875 --> 00:33:20.333
You saw that far ahead?

462
00:33:21.333 --> 00:33:22.333
No.

463
00:33:22.917 --> 00:33:23.875
I told you...

464
00:33:24.167 --> 00:33:27.042
I thought it might come in handy
during battle.

465
00:33:27.667 --> 00:33:29.292
So. I prepared for it.

466
00:33:30.083 --> 00:33:32.958
Take a thousand precautions and
if even one is successful...perfect.

467
00:33:33.333 --> 00:33:36.875
Prepare for
every single possibility.

468
00:33:37.083 --> 00:33:39.000
That's how I am.

469
00:33:39.708 --> 00:33:41.292
That's insane.

470
00:33:41.917 --> 00:33:42.917
How so?

471
00:33:43.833 --> 00:33:45.083
This is a battle.

472
00:33:45.083 --> 00:33:47.083
You lose. you die.

473
00:33:47.167 --> 00:33:49.875
Preparing yourself to death.
to avoid death...

474
00:33:49.875 --> 00:33:51.708
It's something we all do.
don't you think?

475
00:33:52.792 --> 00:33:54.708
You have a point.

476
00:33:54.917 --> 00:33:57.208
I think I finally...

477
00:33:57.958 --> 00:33:59.208
understand why...

478
00:33:59.292 --> 00:34:02.208
you're so frightening...

479
00:34:06.125 --> 00:34:09.375
Stubborn bastard.
Die already.

480
00:34:09.958 --> 00:34:11.125
Mr. Grimmjow!

481
00:34:11.958 --> 00:34:16.208
Killing your enemy was the extent
of our agreement.

482
00:34:16.667 --> 00:34:18.583
Our contract's done.

483
00:34:21.542 --> 00:34:23.917
What the...hell is this?

484
00:34:24.167 --> 00:34:27.708
Oh. I forgot to tell you something...

485
00:34:28.542 --> 00:34:29.583
Bastard! You're still...

486
00:34:29.917 --> 00:34:31.542
When I die.

487
00:34:32.458 --> 00:34:35.875
the effect of Gift Ball Deluxe
intensifies!

488
00:34:37.208 --> 00:34:38.917
It's because the lock that

489
00:34:39.292 --> 00:34:42.875
I unconsciously kept on it
out of fear. to protect myself

490
00:34:42.917 --> 00:34:45.125
is removed.

491
00:34:47.833 --> 00:34:51.292
I would pay my respects to you...

492
00:34:51.708 --> 00:34:54.542
But there's nothing
I can do about it.

493
00:34:55.292 --> 00:34:59.792
I'm guessing you two don't have
the energy left to run.

494
00:34:59.875 --> 00:35:01.708
Sorry about that...

495
00:35:02.292 --> 00:35:03.542
That being said...

496
00:35:04.125 --> 00:35:05.708
Knowing you.

497
00:35:06.292 --> 00:35:08.375
I'm sure you've got an
answer for this. right?

498
00:35:10.833 --> 00:35:12.792
Damn it.

499
00:35:13.208 --> 00:35:14.583
It pisses me off so much.

500
00:35:15.542 --> 00:35:17.792
So. I won't say...

501
00:35:18.417 --> 00:35:20.292
it's fatal...

502
00:35:29.792 --> 00:35:30.792
Damn it!

503
00:35:30.792 --> 00:35:35.708
I'm not letting this thing kill me!

504
00:35:37.208 --> 00:35:38.458
Amazing...

505
00:35:38.833 --> 00:35:42.375
One of the Five Possibilities
he mentioned really happened...

506
00:35:43.292 --> 00:35:46.542
I think there are four
Spiritual Pressures inside.

507
00:35:46.833 --> 00:35:48.208
It will take two round trips.

508
00:35:48.875 --> 00:35:50.042
Where's the entrance?

509
00:35:51.042 --> 00:35:52.417
There?!
It's tiny!

510
00:35:53.542 --> 00:35:56.542
I was actually hoping
to go with Ichigo. but...

511
00:36:03.708 --> 00:36:05.667
Is this it for me?

512
00:36:10.208 --> 00:36:13.917
I'm sorry to leave the rest
up to you like this...

513
00:36:15.542 --> 00:36:18.125
Mr. Kurosaki... Miss Kuchiki...

514
00:36:18.625 --> 00:36:19.667
Everyone...

515
00:36:34.792 --> 00:36:35.958
Do you feel that. Inoue?

516
00:36:37.375 --> 00:36:38.208
Yes.

517
00:36:39.583 --> 00:36:41.000
It's behind that door.

518
00:36:42.708 --> 00:36:43.542
Yes.

519
00:36:45.458 --> 00:36:46.542
We'll go in two on one.

520
00:36:47.708 --> 00:36:48.917
It may be kinda unfair...

521
00:36:49.792 --> 00:36:51.208
I'll leave you
in charge of defense.

522
00:36:52.417 --> 00:36:54.083
I'm counting on you. Inoue.

523
00:36:56.542 --> 00:36:57.375
Okay!

524
00:36:59.167 --> 00:37:00.167
<i>It's finally happening.</i>

525
00:37:01.667 --> 00:37:02.542
<i>Finally...</i>

526
00:37:03.667 --> 00:37:04.625
<i>Finally...</i>

527
00:37:08.583 --> 00:37:11.208
<i>I can finally fight</i>
<i>to protect Kurosaki!</i>

528
00:37:17.542 --> 00:37:18.708
Good of you to come.

529
00:37:19.542 --> 00:37:20.833
I've been waiting.

530
00:37:21.542 --> 00:37:23.208
My son of darkness.

531
00:37:27.458 --> 00:37:28.875
Aren't you going to
draw your sword?

532
00:37:29.542 --> 00:37:31.917
That leaves you quite vulnerable...

533
00:37:33.292 --> 00:37:35.375
...is what I want to say. but...

534
00:37:36.125 --> 00:37:39.542
you're not exactly vulnerable.
are you?

535
00:37:40.333 --> 00:37:41.792
It's like I can almost see

536
00:37:41.833 --> 00:37:44.125
your overflowing Spiritual Pressure
take form.

537
00:37:45.208 --> 00:37:46.875
You've grown strong.

538
00:37:47.583 --> 00:37:48.542
No. I should say...

539
00:37:48.583 --> 00:37:51.792
That is the power
you're supposed to have.

540
00:37:53.292 --> 00:37:54.875
Now come!

541
00:37:55.458 --> 00:37:57.042
Will you come from the right?

542
00:37:57.375 --> 00:37:59.042
Or from the left?

543
00:37:59.583 --> 00:38:01.542
I'm waiting in anticipation.

544
00:38:04.833 --> 00:38:07.375
What's the matter?
Aren't you going to strike at me?

545
00:38:07.625 --> 00:38:11.083
I want to enjoy this long-awaited
talk between father and child.

546
00:38:12.917 --> 00:38:14.000
You're...

547
00:38:14.542 --> 00:38:15.542
not my father.

548
00:38:16.333 --> 00:38:18.125
Ah. you speak of Isshin Kurosaki?

549
00:38:18.542 --> 00:38:21.292
He was just a
stand-in father.

550
00:38:21.792 --> 00:38:24.042
I'm sure you've already been told...

551
00:38:24.292 --> 00:38:26.917
of the origin of your power.

552
00:38:27.375 --> 00:38:28.333
I have.

553
00:38:28.542 --> 00:38:29.792
So what?

554
00:38:30.333 --> 00:38:32.125
You're not my father!

555
00:38:32.458 --> 00:38:34.583
You're the man
who killed one of my parents!

556
00:38:34.833 --> 00:38:36.292
Your mother?

557
00:38:36.292 --> 00:38:37.875
Don't be pathetic!

558
00:38:43.417 --> 00:38:45.125
Getsugatensho!

559
00:39:14.333 --> 00:39:15.958
<i>Simply being able to</i>
<i>"see" the future</i>

560
00:39:16.167 --> 00:39:17.792
<i>doesn't mean he can "win."</i>

561
00:39:18.917 --> 00:39:20.833
<i>I simply have to attack</i>
<i>in a way he can't defend</i>

562
00:39:20.875 --> 00:39:22.458
<i>even if he knows it's coming.</i>

563
00:39:24.042 --> 00:39:28.208
I'm going to send you
and that "almighty" power to the grave.

564
00:39:29.083 --> 00:39:32.125
I will rectify your ignorance.
Uryu Ishida.

565
00:39:33.292 --> 00:39:36.042
Simply grasping everything
about a battlefield

566
00:39:36.667 --> 00:39:39.000
is a far cry from "seeing"
how a battle unfolds.

567
00:39:40.000 --> 00:39:44.667
You sent Ichigo Kurosaki to fight
the most important battle.

568
00:39:45.292 --> 00:39:47.583
You probably calculated on Ichigo
defeating His Majesty

569
00:39:47.583 --> 00:39:49.583
when he is without The Almighty.

570
00:39:50.417 --> 00:39:51.792
That was a reasonable strategy.

571
00:39:52.542 --> 00:39:54.292
But a mistaken one.

572
00:40:06.125 --> 00:40:07.583
The power of the Soul King!

573
00:40:31.542 --> 00:40:33.583
What is there to be sad about?

574
00:40:34.208 --> 00:40:36.625
She died as she was supposed to.

575
00:40:37.458 --> 00:40:40.917
She gave birth to you
and lived for me.

576
00:40:41.375 --> 00:40:42.708
What more could she want?

577
00:40:43.125 --> 00:40:45.542
There is no greater happiness!

578
00:40:51.125 --> 00:40:52.167
Kurosaki!

579
00:40:54.708 --> 00:40:56.042
Kurosaki!

580
00:40:59.042 --> 00:41:00.917
Our conversation is finished.

581
00:41:01.292 --> 00:41:02.542
It was fun.

582
00:41:04.208 --> 00:41:05.458
Now...

583
00:41:05.875 --> 00:41:08.292
Shall we fight. Ichigo?

584
00:41:08.833 --> 00:41:12.708
It was a smart choice to focus on
the The Almighty.

585
00:41:13.292 --> 00:41:14.125
However...

586
00:41:14.542 --> 00:41:17.792
It was overly arrogant of you
to try to measure His Majesty.

587
00:41:23.333 --> 00:41:24.542
The Almighty.

588
00:41:31.542 --> 00:41:35.792
What was it that you thought you knew
about me. Uryu Ishida?

589
00:41:41.917 --> 00:41:43.875
Despair begins now.

590
00:41:54.625 --> 00:41:55.875
Wait. Kurosaki!

591
00:42:00.458 --> 00:42:02.583
A reckless charge.

592
00:42:02.875 --> 00:42:05.833
What did you bring that woman for?

593
00:42:06.292 --> 00:42:09.000
Did hatred make you
lose control of yourself?

594
00:42:10.167 --> 00:42:11.708
Don't be so impatient.

595
00:42:15.667 --> 00:42:19.083
You will eventually be consumed
by me and die.

596
00:42:19.083 --> 00:42:21.792
but it's no fun
if you rush to your death.

597
00:42:22.542 --> 00:42:24.917
Do you have any idea
how much time and

598
00:42:24.917 --> 00:42:27.792
how many miracles it took
to create you?

599
00:42:28.958 --> 00:42:29.875
Don't be impatient.

600
00:42:30.292 --> 00:42:32.583
Don't treat your life so lightly.

601
00:42:33.458 --> 00:42:34.792
Your body...

602
00:42:34.917 --> 00:42:36.292
Your power...

603
00:42:36.333 --> 00:42:38.542
They do not belong to you. Ichigo.

604
00:42:39.208 --> 00:42:43.375
Expend all of your power
and die. Ichigo!

605
00:42:52.083 --> 00:42:53.292
Where am I?

606
00:42:53.792 --> 00:42:55.458
I can't see a thing...

607
00:42:56.208 --> 00:42:57.792
What is this place?

608
00:43:09.125 --> 00:43:13.333
Expend all of your power
and die. Ichigo!

609
00:43:14.667 --> 00:43:16.083
Santenkesshun!

610
00:43:19.292 --> 00:43:20.292
Shitenkoshun!!

611
00:43:21.208 --> 00:43:23.000
Ah. the power of rejection.

612
00:43:23.208 --> 00:43:24.125
I...

613
00:43:24.625 --> 00:43:25.583
reject!

614
00:43:26.583 --> 00:43:27.833
You can't reject me completely.

615
00:43:34.917 --> 00:43:39.458
The same powers that flow
within Ichigo flow within me.

616
00:43:40.208 --> 00:43:44.208
So. you unconsciously
accept my attacks.

617
00:44:15.583 --> 00:44:16.458
Woman...

618
00:44:16.792 --> 00:44:18.292
Consider it an honor...

619
00:44:18.792 --> 00:44:22.792
that a mere human like you.
who overstepped her bounds.

620
00:44:23.083 --> 00:44:24.958
could even be here.

621
00:44:26.458 --> 00:44:28.625
I won't let you...
...hurt him

622
00:44:32.292 --> 00:44:33.833
I will protect him!

623
00:44:39.083 --> 00:44:40.042
And that...

624
00:44:41.208 --> 00:44:42.208
is why...

625
00:44:44.167 --> 00:44:45.792
I reject!

626
00:45:00.875 --> 00:45:03.417
Getsugatensho!

627
00:45:09.542 --> 00:45:10.875
I will kill you.

628
00:45:11.958 --> 00:45:13.875
Such hubris. Ichigo.

629
00:45:14.042 --> 00:45:16.917
To do that would be the same as
killing the world.

630
00:45:18.792 --> 00:45:23.167
For I've already become
the world itself!

631
00:45:23.958 --> 00:45:26.542
While I possess
His Majesty's powers.

632
00:45:27.042 --> 00:45:30.542
I can wield them as I please.

633
00:45:30.958 --> 00:45:34.000
This is the power that I hold
as his other half.

634
00:45:35.083 --> 00:45:40.375
Uryu Ishida. if you did indeed
survive His Majesty's Auswählen.

635
00:45:41.208 --> 00:45:45.292
then prove it once more
by surviving my powers.

636
00:46:00.542 --> 00:46:03.792
Your fight has been a contradiction
from the very beginning.

637
00:46:04.000 --> 00:46:05.375
You should have seen that already.

638
00:46:05.917 --> 00:46:08.583
You know just how fragile
the balance of this world is

639
00:46:08.833 --> 00:46:10.833
and how easily it can be shaken...

640
00:46:11.792 --> 00:46:15.292
Killing His Majesty.
who has become one with the Soul King.

641
00:46:15.375 --> 00:46:18.917
would condemn
this world to its end.

642
00:46:37.333 --> 00:46:38.667
How pathetic.

643
00:46:44.583 --> 00:46:48.042
If we defeat Yhwach.
the world will crumble...

644
00:46:48.708 --> 00:46:50.875
I'm completely aware of that.

645
00:46:53.292 --> 00:46:54.292
Then why...?

646
00:46:54.417 --> 00:46:55.417
But...

647
00:46:56.458 --> 00:46:58.667
Kurosaki might say this...

648
00:46:59.458 --> 00:47:01.208
I'm still going to take you down.

649
00:47:02.042 --> 00:47:05.417
I know the people who have
always protected this world.

650
00:47:06.042 --> 00:47:09.875
You are trampling on the very thing
they want to protect.

651
00:47:11.458 --> 00:47:13.958
There are countless lives
I want to protect.

652
00:47:14.417 --> 00:47:19.292
I want to protect their feelings
and all that they hold dear.

653
00:47:20.208 --> 00:47:23.917
If that means destroying the world.
then so be it...

654
00:47:24.958 --> 00:47:26.000
Here I come.

655
00:47:26.792 --> 00:47:29.083
Getsuga Jujisho!

656
00:47:30.083 --> 00:47:31.542
Have you realized it yet?

657
00:47:33.542 --> 00:47:36.208
Even if you people can win
against His Majesty.

658
00:47:36.583 --> 00:47:38.042
now that the Soul King is gone.

659
00:47:38.542 --> 00:47:40.792
do you realize what will be
necessary to preserve

660
00:47:40.875 --> 00:47:42.542
the world as you know it?

661
00:47:48.542 --> 00:47:49.917
Even that didn't work...

662
00:47:50.792 --> 00:47:51.792
Ichigo...

663
00:47:51.875 --> 00:47:54.958
My son born in the darkness...

664
00:47:55.625 --> 00:47:57.583
You might be ignorant.

665
00:47:58.042 --> 00:48:00.542
but you understand everything
instinctually.

666
00:48:00.958 --> 00:48:02.958
And because
you understand everything.

667
00:48:03.042 --> 00:48:05.792
you hesitate to take me down.

668
00:48:07.917 --> 00:48:10.083
Ichibe Hyosube...

669
00:48:10.542 --> 00:48:13.333
Everything is happening exactly
according to his plan.

670
00:48:13.792 --> 00:48:15.792
He took you in. Ichigo Kurosaki...

671
00:48:15.875 --> 00:48:19.542
and gave you the Soul King's memories
and explained everything.

672
00:48:19.917 --> 00:48:23.667
He did it to judge
whether Ichigo Kurosaki

673
00:48:23.667 --> 00:48:25.875
was worthy of existence.

674
00:48:26.625 --> 00:48:27.708
You are a miracle.

675
00:48:28.375 --> 00:48:31.833
You are human. Soul Reaper.

676
00:48:32.000 --> 00:48:36.917
Hollow. Fullbringer. and Quincy.

677
00:48:37.542 --> 00:48:42.792
You likely never thought about
the true essence of your powers...

678
00:48:42.833 --> 00:48:46.167
Why do you clad yourself
in black?

679
00:48:46.625 --> 00:48:48.625
Black is the color of chaos...

680
00:48:49.000 --> 00:48:51.333
Chaos is the power of
the Soul King.

681
00:48:52.042 --> 00:48:53.917
Black—the color without color—

682
00:48:54.000 --> 00:48:56.292
is nothing less than
the Soul King's Spiritual Pressure.

683
00:48:57.083 --> 00:49:01.417
And the one who controls that black
is Ichibe Hyosube.

684
00:49:01.917 --> 00:49:06.583
I'm sure he said to you.
"Protect the Soul King."

685
00:49:08.208 --> 00:49:12.292
I'm sorry...
So sorry...

686
00:49:26.792 --> 00:49:29.792
<i>You're the only one being taken</i>
<i>for a different reason.</i>

687
00:49:30.417 --> 00:49:32.833
<i>Are you a vessel</i>
<i>capable of withstanding</i>

688
00:49:32.833 --> 00:49:35.292
<i>the power that fills it.</i>

689
00:49:35.333 --> 00:49:37.292
<i>or are you a bowl that shatters?</i>

690
00:49:37.542 --> 00:49:42.333
<i>I was able to receive a tiny bit of</i>
<i>your power to restore my own body.</i>

691
00:49:42.708 --> 00:49:45.625
<i>Please protect the Soul King.</i>
<i>Ichigo!</i>

692
00:49:46.833 --> 00:49:49.375
I will tell you his true intent.

693
00:49:50.292 --> 00:49:55.917
Ichibe Hyosube intended to
install you as the next Soul King.

694
00:49:57.792 --> 00:49:58.583
No way!

695
00:49:59.125 --> 00:50:01.042
He was going to
make you a figurehead

696
00:50:01.125 --> 00:50:04.167
whose only purpose is
to preserve the Three Worlds.

697
00:50:04.625 --> 00:50:09.000
So a world with Soul Reapers as the
pinnacle would be maintained.

698
00:50:09.625 --> 00:50:12.917
That is Ichibe Hyosube's
vision of "peace."

699
00:50:13.583 --> 00:50:16.875
For you. it may as well be "death."

700
00:50:21.875 --> 00:50:23.792
So what?

701
00:50:24.792 --> 00:50:26.208
So what?

702
00:50:26.958 --> 00:50:27.792
What?

703
00:50:28.167 --> 00:50:29.000
It's just...

704
00:50:29.542 --> 00:50:31.875
I figured that's what
Kurosaki would say.

705
00:50:32.708 --> 00:50:37.458
Why does it matter if
I become the Soul King or not?!

706
00:50:39.958 --> 00:50:41.792
What I know right now. is...

707
00:50:43.417 --> 00:50:47.792
Unless I take you down.
I'll have nothing to protect!

708
00:50:48.667 --> 00:50:50.375
Yhwach!

709
00:51:04.458 --> 00:51:06.208
What the hell is that monster?

710
00:51:06.333 --> 00:51:08.667
He's so strong. he made you
pee your pants a little. Hachi!

711
00:51:08.708 --> 00:51:11.042
I haven't peed my pants.

712
00:51:15.208 --> 00:51:16.375
Too easy!

713
00:51:16.792 --> 00:51:20.583
Is this all you Thirteen Court
Guard Squad captains can muster

714
00:51:20.583 --> 00:51:22.208
against my Miracle?

715
00:51:23.125 --> 00:51:27.583
I can already barely sense
your faint Spiritual Pressure.

716
00:51:28.125 --> 00:51:31.917
It'll be like stepping on ants
in the sand.

717
00:51:32.542 --> 00:51:34.708
It's close to impossible...

718
00:51:36.292 --> 00:51:38.583
That is exactly why I can find you!

719
00:51:38.792 --> 00:51:41.708
Did you think I wouldn't be able to
find you because it's impossible?

720
00:51:42.000 --> 00:51:44.708
It's a "Miracle" because
the impossible becomes possible!

721
00:51:44.917 --> 00:51:47.125
We weren't listening
to you earlier.

722
00:51:47.167 --> 00:51:51.542
so your "Miracle" is just
gibberish to us. baldy!

723
00:51:51.917 --> 00:51:53.792
I am not bald!

724
00:51:54.042 --> 00:51:55.708
What kinda comeback was that?!

725
00:51:57.833 --> 00:51:58.792
Are you being serious?!

726
00:52:01.583 --> 00:52:04.208
You think I'd fall for that?!

727
00:52:04.792 --> 00:52:08.292
Nah. I didn't.
Not if it was just me.

728
00:52:09.792 --> 00:52:10.958
Sakanade.

729
00:52:14.792 --> 00:52:16.667
The world flipped!

730
00:52:18.417 --> 00:52:20.000
Everything's upside-down.

731
00:52:26.708 --> 00:52:27.792
Now. everybody!

732
00:52:30.625 --> 00:52:33.208
I'll let you hear the Tritone

733
00:52:33.875 --> 00:52:35.292
Tekken Tachikaze!

734
00:52:35.583 --> 00:52:37.833
Super Mashiro Kick!

735
00:52:42.167 --> 00:52:44.458
Chocolate Bar Slider!

736
00:52:44.583 --> 00:52:46.208
Hifuki no Kozuchi!

737
00:52:46.333 --> 00:52:47.917
Nijuichijo Tonbokudari!

738
00:52:50.792 --> 00:52:51.958
It's over.

739
00:52:58.792 --> 00:52:59.625
We did it...

740
00:53:10.583 --> 00:53:11.625
Boy. oh boy...

741
00:53:12.000 --> 00:53:14.667
It'll never end at this rate.

742
00:53:15.333 --> 00:53:16.417
Oh. I know...

743
00:53:16.708 --> 00:53:18.375
I'll just drop this entire area

744
00:53:18.875 --> 00:53:21.292
along with them all.

745
00:53:26.458 --> 00:53:28.875
I can't allow you to let them fall.

746
00:53:34.458 --> 00:53:36.833
Stay frozen here forever.

747
00:53:37.875 --> 00:53:39.542
Who said that?

748
00:53:40.083 --> 00:53:42.917
Captain of Squad 10 of
the Thirteen Court Guard Squads.

749
00:53:43.583 --> 00:53:45.292
Toshiro Hitsugaya.

750
00:53:46.625 --> 00:53:47.667
Is that so?

751
00:53:47.792 --> 00:53:52.792
I am Stern Ritter Gerard Valkyrie
of the Royal Guards.

752
00:53:56.542 --> 00:53:58.333
Let's be friends!

753
00:53:59.708 --> 00:54:00.833
Sorry.

754
00:54:01.625 --> 00:54:03.542
I didn't come here to be friends.

755
00:54:05.792 --> 00:54:06.833
Bankai.

756
00:54:07.542 --> 00:54:09.542
Daiguren Hyorinmaru.

757
00:54:16.708 --> 00:54:17.542
Shiro...

758
00:54:24.542 --> 00:54:25.792
I see...

759
00:54:32.208 --> 00:54:34.042
What a childish answer...

760
00:54:37.042 --> 00:54:37.875
Kurosaki!

761
00:54:39.792 --> 00:54:41.458
So it falls on the father

762
00:54:41.542 --> 00:54:43.333
to correct the child's error.
I suppose.

763
00:55:00.542 --> 00:55:01.708
<i>He's so fast...</i>

764
00:55:02.333 --> 00:55:04.125
<i>I can't follow</i>
<i>Kurosaki's movements...!</i>

765
00:55:31.542 --> 00:55:32.833
Kurosaki. wait!

766
00:55:33.000 --> 00:55:35.167
Calm down for a second!

767
00:55:51.083 --> 00:55:52.333
I don't understand...

768
00:55:52.792 --> 00:55:54.667
Why rush to your death?

769
00:55:59.042 --> 00:56:02.583
Are you reluctant to show me
all of your power?

770
00:56:02.833 --> 00:56:06.583
Are you afraid I'll take it.
if you show it to me?

771
00:56:07.375 --> 00:56:09.792
But is that all right. Ichigo?

772
00:56:10.125 --> 00:56:12.083
If you die here.

773
00:56:12.292 --> 00:56:15.000
both the World of the Living and
Soul Society are done.

774
00:56:15.458 --> 00:56:17.083
I will end them.

775
00:56:17.708 --> 00:56:19.667
Are you okay with that. Ichigo?

776
00:56:28.458 --> 00:56:29.458
Look.

777
00:56:29.583 --> 00:56:32.708
Your friend is saying
that must not happen.

778
00:56:33.208 --> 00:56:36.958
She's telling you to heal
your wounds and fight.

779
00:56:37.292 --> 00:56:41.583
You never had a choice
to begin with.

780
00:56:42.083 --> 00:56:43.417
Answer. Ichigo!

781
00:56:43.792 --> 00:56:45.792
To the voices of the powerless.

782
00:56:47.333 --> 00:56:48.792
For the weak...

783
00:56:49.000 --> 00:56:52.583
who. without you...
can barely breathe.

784
00:56:54.417 --> 00:56:55.292
Stand up.

785
00:56:57.167 --> 00:56:58.042
Fight.

786
00:56:59.417 --> 00:57:00.792
And die!

787
00:57:23.042 --> 00:57:25.042
Thanks. Inoue.

788
00:57:25.917 --> 00:57:26.792
Sure!

789
00:57:27.292 --> 00:57:31.458
I barely grabbed your clothes...
but you stopped. Kurosaki.

790
00:57:32.333 --> 00:57:33.417
When you looked back.

791
00:57:33.625 --> 00:57:35.875
I didn't see the face of a person
who had lost himself.

792
00:57:36.583 --> 00:57:39.417
I knew you had something in mind.

793
00:57:40.542 --> 00:57:41.375
Yeah...

794
00:57:42.208 --> 00:57:44.542
There was a guy I wanted to wake up

795
00:57:44.667 --> 00:57:46.583
by pumping in some
Quincy Spiritual Pressure.

796
00:57:48.333 --> 00:57:49.292
<i>His sword...</i>

797
00:57:49.833 --> 00:57:50.875
<i>is turning white...</i>

798
00:57:56.208 --> 00:57:57.458
I see...

799
00:57:57.458 --> 00:57:59.875
So that's what
you were trying to do.

800
00:58:11.125 --> 00:58:12.708
Okay. now for the finishing move.

801
00:58:17.542 --> 00:58:19.417
It couldn't even stop him
for a moment...

802
00:58:19.667 --> 00:58:21.292
He's a tough bastard.

803
00:58:21.333 --> 00:58:26.792
Did you think you could stop me
with these ice tricks?

804
00:58:34.125 --> 00:58:35.000
That saved me...

805
00:58:39.083 --> 00:58:41.292
I don't like The Miracle.

806
00:58:42.292 --> 00:58:43.292
but it's powerful.

807
00:58:44.125 --> 00:58:45.125
Agreed.

808
00:58:45.583 --> 00:58:48.125
He's a difficult opponent
to take on one-on-one.

809
00:58:48.208 --> 00:58:49.208
Let me help.

810
00:58:49.458 --> 00:58:50.458
Understood.

811
00:58:50.792 --> 00:58:52.667
Given the difference in height.

812
00:58:52.792 --> 00:58:55.292
two against one
wouldn't be cowardly...

813
00:58:56.833 --> 00:58:58.292
Why are you looking at me
like that?

814
00:58:58.292 --> 00:59:01.292
You wanna say that I'm always
at a height disadvantage?

815
00:59:02.417 --> 00:59:03.542
No. of course not...

816
00:59:03.833 --> 00:59:05.958
That's...not my intent.

817
00:59:06.833 --> 00:59:08.625
- Sorry.
- Then why'd you apologize?!

818
00:59:08.708 --> 00:59:11.292
You hesitated.
and then apologized anyway!

819
00:59:11.292 --> 00:59:12.208
Look at me!

820
00:59:17.542 --> 00:59:18.792
What's this?

821
00:59:18.958 --> 00:59:21.917
Captain classes
all got obliterated together?

822
00:59:23.333 --> 00:59:24.333
So pathetic!

823
00:59:25.417 --> 00:59:27.292
- Here comes trouble...
- Here comes trouble...

824
00:59:30.042 --> 00:59:33.167
My...my right hand!

825
00:59:34.333 --> 00:59:36.542
Is stronger!

826
00:59:37.042 --> 00:59:39.208
What's that?
What just happened?!

827
00:59:39.458 --> 00:59:40.958
That's his power.

828
00:59:41.125 --> 00:59:43.917
Any injured area on his body
grows bigger and stronger.

829
00:59:44.292 --> 00:59:45.542
I see.

830
00:59:45.792 --> 00:59:49.042
That means he wasn't this big
from the start.

831
00:59:50.375 --> 00:59:51.208
What?

832
00:59:51.417 --> 00:59:53.125
If you've got something to say.
just say it!

833
00:59:53.792 --> 00:59:54.583
I don't.

834
00:59:55.083 --> 00:59:56.292
You're being hyper-sensitive.

835
00:59:57.167 --> 00:59:58.083
How fun!

836
00:59:58.917 --> 01:00:03.292
Let's find out what happens if
we dice him up into pieces!

837
01:00:03.792 --> 01:00:05.125
That idiot!

838
01:00:08.667 --> 01:00:10.125
What do you think you're doing?

839
01:00:10.208 --> 01:00:14.000
You woulda been sliced in two
if I hadn't held back!

840
01:00:14.292 --> 01:00:16.208
You're more considerate
than I thought.

841
01:00:16.667 --> 01:00:18.833
Now put a little more thought
into it...

842
01:00:19.333 --> 01:00:21.417
Huh? What are you talking about?

843
01:00:21.458 --> 01:00:25.792
What will happen if we make him
any bigger. and he falls?

844
01:00:26.042 --> 01:00:27.417
Nothing.

845
01:00:27.458 --> 01:00:30.292
I'll fall with him and slice him up
on the way down.

846
01:00:30.542 --> 01:00:33.333
If someone with all that mass
falls from this height.

847
01:00:33.542 --> 01:00:35.458
Seireitei will be destroyed!

848
01:00:52.542 --> 01:00:54.542
Stop with the quibbling!

849
01:00:54.917 --> 01:00:57.167
So in other words.
I just have to stop toying with him

850
01:00:57.208 --> 01:00:59.625
and go straight to cracking
his head open. right?

851
01:01:02.125 --> 01:01:03.000
Zaraki!

852
01:01:05.375 --> 01:01:07.167
You made me fall over.

853
01:01:07.167 --> 01:01:08.667
You're strong...

854
01:01:10.167 --> 01:01:13.000
I hate to be cruel.
but you leave me no choice.

855
01:01:13.417 --> 01:01:16.542
A powerful embodiment of darkness
such as yourself

856
01:01:16.833 --> 01:01:19.792
shall become rust on my Hoffnung.

857
01:01:20.708 --> 01:01:23.167
Can't believe I couldn't cut you.

858
01:01:23.375 --> 01:01:26.292
A tough shield
and a tough body. huh?

859
01:01:27.292 --> 01:01:29.292
Makes me wanna cut you even more.

860
01:01:30.125 --> 01:01:30.958
Drink...

861
01:01:33.833 --> 01:01:35.083
Nozarashi.

862
01:01:36.167 --> 01:01:37.333
What is that?

863
01:01:37.542 --> 01:01:38.542
His Shikai?

864
01:01:39.125 --> 01:01:40.917
When did Zaraki...?

865
01:01:41.375 --> 01:01:45.958
So. his sword wasn't
a constant-release type.

866
01:01:46.458 --> 01:01:47.292
No...

867
01:01:47.625 --> 01:01:51.208
Perhaps a constant-release type

868
01:01:51.208 --> 01:01:53.042
never existed in the first place...

869
01:02:09.042 --> 01:02:09.958
You fool!

870
01:02:10.542 --> 01:02:13.083
You chipped my Hoffnung!

871
01:02:18.958 --> 01:02:20.417
Senbonzakura Kageyoshi.

872
01:02:21.042 --> 01:02:22.042
Hyoryusenbi...

873
01:02:24.667 --> 01:02:25.542
Zekku!

874
01:02:36.292 --> 01:02:38.958
Do you wish that badly for despair?

875
01:02:39.833 --> 01:02:42.625
What's this?
What's happening?

876
01:02:43.000 --> 01:02:44.417
What's puzzling you?

877
01:02:44.792 --> 01:02:46.458
My power is The Miracle.

878
01:02:46.708 --> 01:02:50.042
The Miracle turns
the people's wishes into reality.

879
01:02:50.583 --> 01:02:55.125
My indestructible body is enlarged
by the people's fears.

880
01:02:55.417 --> 01:02:59.125
Hoffnung is forged from
the hopes of the people.

881
01:02:59.292 --> 01:03:02.167
When it shatters.
there will be despair!!

882
01:03:02.833 --> 01:03:05.542
I am Gerard Valkyrie!

883
01:03:06.083 --> 01:03:10.542
I am a miracle.
and miracles are what I am.
